			"text": "# Electro Pipeline v19\n**生產預設** Neutral=1.3776, 100/100 合法, 99/100 快過中位數"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-002",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -70,
			"y": -100,
			"width": 480,
			"height": 1100,
			"label": "初始化（優先序退回：Dirichlet→ML→Random）"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-003",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": -40,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "**Random Init**\n（三者都關閉/失敗時的最終備援）"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-004",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 150,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "**Dirichlet 調和延拓初始化**\n生產預設（取代舊 Jacobi）\n`ELECTRO_DIRICHLET_INIT=1`\nGraph Laplacian 封閉解\n全 100 案 Neutral 1.4018→1.3776 (-1.73%)"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-005",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 410,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "**ML 暖啟動**\n`ELECTRO_ML_INIT=1`（生產預設）\nseeds>1 才使用"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-010",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 630,
			"y": -50,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "## Stage 1: analytical_place()\nAdam 梯度下降 300 步\n+ MIB_ANCHOR_SNAP（訓練中引導）\n+ MIB_ANCHOR（輸出前對齊）"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-011",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1230,
			"y": -50,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "## Stage 2a: legalize()\n順序抽取 → 壓實 → cleanup\n⚡ FAST_CLEANUP (2.4×)"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-060",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 630,
			"y": 220,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "2",
			"text": "## Stage 2b: slice_pack()\nGuillotine 遞迴切割\n+ SLICE_ALIGN_PORTFOLIO\n兩種方向都保留成候選"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-012",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1830,
			"y": -35,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "4",
			"text": "## Stage 3: soft_repair()\nboundary snap + wide-swap\ngrouping push-past"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-020",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 900,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "2",
			"text": "**place-compact**\n`ELECTRO_PLACE_COMPACT=1`\n中心點新初始化 + 短版\nTOPK=3 (75% 省計算)"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-021",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1350,
			"y": 500,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "2",
			"text": "**LP 位移最小化**\n`ELECTRO_LP_DISPLACEMENT=1`\nLP 式最小位移 legalize\n獨立額外候選"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-040",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1100,
			"y": 750,
			"width": 380,
			"height": 140,
			"color": "3",
			"text": "**Proxy Cost 排名**\nexp(2·V_rel)·(hpwl/ha + area/aa)\n錨點跟候選池無關"
